'''Skygazer Hill''' was a location on the remote moon of [[Yavin 4]]. Sometime after the [[Battle of Hoth]] and before the [[Battle of Endor]], a battle between the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] and [[Galactic Empire]] occurred here.<ref name="C" />

